{"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"batch"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO","text":"AsyncSequences"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Batch","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO5BatchV","text":"Batch"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent13BatchStrategyP","text":"BatchStrategy"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sci7ElementQa","text":"Element"},{"kind":"text","text":" == "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/Element","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent13BatchStrategyP7ElementQa","text":"Element"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"strategy","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When to emit the gathered elements; its "},{"code":"Element","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sequence’s, inferred from the call."}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A sequence of the upstream’s elements, in order, in arrays of one or more."}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The strategy decides when the pending elements are flushed: every so many elements"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/count(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"), every interval"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/time(interval:clock:tolerance:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"), on a signal or a unit of work"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/SignalBatchStrategy","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"), whenever any of several does"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/either(_:_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"), or by a rule of your own ("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"). After every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"flush, each strategy starts over. A flush with nothing pending emits nothing; the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sequence never emits an empty array."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When the upstream finishes, the pending elements, if any, are emitted as a last array and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the sequence finishes. When the upstream throws, the pending elements are dropped and the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sequence throws the same error. A signal that finishes stops firing while the batches go","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"on; a signal that throws ends the sequence with its error.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The upstream and the strategy run in tasks of their own, started when iteration begins,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so the upstream is read ahead of the consumer, and arrays the consumer hasn’t taken yet","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are buffered. Cancelling the consumer, or dropping its iterator, cancels both. An","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"upstream or signal that ignores cancellation keeps the internal task alive until its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pending ","type":"text"},{"code":"next()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" returns, and is not read again after that; the batched sequence itself","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ends at once.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Batching needs iOS 16, Mac Catalyst 16, macOS 13, tvOS 16, watchOS 9 or visionOS 1.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Example","text":"Example","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["for try await batch in [1, 2, 3, 4].async.batch(strategy: .either(.count(3), .time(interval: .seconds(1), clock: ContinuousClock()))) {","    print(batch) \/\/ Prints [1, 2, 3], then [4]","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"name":"Throws","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Any error the upstream or the strategy throws."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note","type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Throttle"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Gathers elements into arrays and emits each array when the strategy says to flush.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Throttle\/batch(strategy:)"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncsequences\/throttle\/batch(strategy:)"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","extendedModule":"_Concurrency","modules":[{"name":"Afluent","relatedModules":["_Concurrency"]}],"platforms":[{"introducedAt":"16.0","name":"iOS","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false},{"introducedAt":"16.0","name":"iPadOS","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false},{"introducedAt":"16.0","name":"Mac Catalyst","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false},{"introducedAt":"13.0","name":"macOS","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false},{"introducedAt":"16.0","name":"tvOS","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false},{"introducedAt":"1.0","name":"visionOS","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false},{"introducedAt":"9.0","name":"watchOS","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false}],"role":"symbol","title":"batch(strategy:)","externalID":"s:Sci7Afluents8SendableRzsAB7ElementRpzrlE5batch8strategyAA14AsyncSequencesO5BatchVy_xqd__Gqd___tAA0H8StrategyRd__ACQyd__ADRSlF::SYNTHESIZED::s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO8ThrottleV","conformance":{"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Self"},{"text":" conforms to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Element"},{"text":" conforms to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"text":"Conforms when","type":"text"}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"text":"Available